I was wandering around with a wand of polymorph and a ring of polymorph control
when I ran into a load of orcs. I zapped myself into a demon and started bashing
them up a bit! Then (and this is the bit I want to know about) I got a message:

       some hell-p has arrived

and two demons came and helped me with the orcs. They then stayed around (like
familiars) even when I reverted to human form.

My question is why did this happen? Does it always happen? Any other useful
info? (Okay that's three questions!)

